  "name_en": "Lava Tunnel Adventure",
  "summary_zh": "Raufarhólshellir 是位於 Reykjavík 東南方約 30 公里的大型熔岩隧道，官方英文品牌名稱為 The Lava Tunnel，約 30 分鐘車程可以抵達。\n\n想深度了解冰島的「岩漿 LAVA」如何形影響這片大地，這行程是非常推薦。\n\n全程非常輕鬆沒有難度，也不用換裝、上冰爪等等(但實際情況要視季節、現場狀況)，僅需一頂安全帽就好，裡面會有點冷，防寒衣物不能少。",
  "summary_en": "Raufarhólshellir is a large lava tunnel located about 30 km southeast of Reykjavík, reachable in roughly a 30‑minute drive. The tour is easy with no technical difficulty; you only need a safety helmet, and while it can be chilly inside, bring warm clothing. Parking and restroom facilities are available on site for free. The recommended visit duration is 120 minutes. This experience is highly recommended for those who want to learn how volcanic lava has shaped the Icelandic landscape.",
